OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured after car driven at
OL,4,Ahim in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a car was driven at a man in
OL,8,FKeighley, according to police.
OL,10,FA man in his 30s was assaulted in the
OL,11,Fstreet by another man who then got into
OL,12,Fa BMW car and drove it at him just
OL,13,Fafter 20:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe victim was taken to hospital with
OL,16,Fleg injuries, which are not being
OL,17,Ftreated as life threatening, police
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,FThe incident took place at the junction
OL,21,Fof Cavendish Street and Lawkholme Lane.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
